50	\caption{LoRA rank ablation for \cwm{} 4B (seed 42, 3 epochs, lr $= 2{\times}10^{-4}$). Rank-16 seed variance: 0.53\pp{} (seeds 42 vs.\ 456).}
51	\label{tab:rank_ablation}
